      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose is well above the maximum and may be a typo.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **Each dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times a day is 6400 mg/day. That's twice the usual prescription maximum of 3200 mg/day, which is already the top of the range.\n- **Risk:** At these doses, the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury and heart problems goes up a lot, even in a 70 kg adult with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**What you might have meant:**\n1. **400 mg by mouth four times a day** (1600 mg/day total). This is a common way the number gets mixed up.\n2. **800 mg by mouth four times a day** (3200 mg/day). This is the maximum prescription dose.\n3. **Something else.** Tell me the dose and how often.\n\nIf you do mean 1600 mg four times a day, please confirm and give a short reason, and I'll enter it with a note documenting that you confirmed a dose above the maximum."
      }
     ],
